    LLM: 'Game: Baccarat Punto Banco. Type: Fixed-Rule Banking. Rules: 8 decks. Natural 8/9 ends hand. Player draws on 0-5. Banker draws based on specific matrix. Winning Banker pays 1:1 minus 5% commission.',
