          deckDescription: 'One standard 52-card deck consisting of four suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs), each with thirteen ranks from ace down to two. No jokers; used for punto banco where players bet on Player or Banker and only point totals matter.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs). Suits play no role; only the baccarat value of each card (ace one, two–nine face value, ten and faces zero) is used for the hand total.',
